# DosePrepped — Docker build context excludes (M6.1)
# Keeps the `docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .` context small and
# avoids ever baking local secrets or generated artifacts into an image
# layer (they're regenerated inside the build anyway).

node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
packages/db/generated

# Local env files — real values are passed to `docker run`/the hosting
# platform as environment variables, never baked into the image.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

.git
.DS_Store
*.log
